• Keep track of where you’ve spent the night and who was with you\n\n[Navigation]\n• Get the route to join your people or places with Apple Maps or call an Uber straight there\n• Share your live ETA to your friends’ lockscreen\n• Buzz your friends when nearby to get their attention\n\n[All the extra stuff]\n• Turn your photos & videos into stickers to send whatever you want\n• Get notified when friends travel to other states or countries\n• Use ghost mode to take time off the map\n• Add location widgets to your home screen to quickly see what friends are up to\n• Also works for friends who don't have iPhones!\n• Siri & Shortcuts integration\n• Free app\n• Lots more coming soon!\n\n[EULA]\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\nBump has been featured by Apple, TechCrunch, Business Insider, Highsnobiety, Wired and many more. They love Bump and you will too.\n\nFor questions, feature requests and exclusive merch, drop us a DM on Instagram: @bumpbyamo.","averageUserRating":4.8875,"trackCensoredName":"Bump - real life is happening","languageCodesISO2A":["BG","KM","HR","CS","DA","EN","ET","FI","FR","EL","HU","ID","IT","JA","KO","LT","MS","NB","PL","PT","RO","RU","SR","ZH","ES","SV","TH","ZH","TR","UK","VI"],"fileSizeBytes":"407815168","formattedPrice":"Free","contentAdvisoryRating":"12+","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1200,"trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/bump-real-life-is-happening/id6471519217?uo=4","trackContentRating":"12+","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.8875,"releaseDate":"2023-12-19T08:00:00Z","userRatingCount":1200}